        "title": "Swarm agent deletion now drains remote machines cleanly",
        "summary": "Deleting an agent backed by the swarm gateway now coordinates a stop-and-retry flow with the remote machine instead of leaving orphaned status probe agents behind.",
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Agent deletion now detects swarm-backed agents via machine type and routes them through the swarm gateway, returning a clear service-unavailable error when SWARM_BASE_URL isn't configured rather than silently leaving the remote agent running.",
